  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Apprentice Notes Winter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Apprentice Notes
  content: 'Things I''ve Learned This Week


    Dust gets everywhere.

    Never
    shelve a book from memory.

    Labels matter more than I thought.

    Professor
    Eleanor somehow notices every misplaced volume.

    Mr. Hartwell can hear someone
    folding page corners from across the room.


    I still don''t know how.'
